You need to look at your termcap file and see what terminal type your
are running - most likely it is set to "unix default" which means the
control-j etc keys do cursor movements, but not the arrow keys. You
might try changing the "O"ptions to a vt type terminal instead as well.
In addition you might try just playing in straight console (no X) and
change your character set to a larger font. 

